	TEXT(R"RTD({"gas":{"name":"gas","version":"1.0.0","description":"Gameplay Ability System at runtime: inspect and drive attributes, gameplay effects, abilities, gameplay events,\nloose tags and cues on any actor, including builder objects with no ability system (Epic GASToolsets inspection,\nplus runtime drivers).\n\nWorkflow:\n1. gas.add_ability_system on the actor (adds an AbilitySystemComponent and the generic attribute set: Health,\n   MaxHealth, Shield, Stamina, MaxStamina, Mana, MaxMana, Speed, Damage). Actors that already own an ability system\n   (project characters) work directly.\n2. gas.define_effect for each buff/debuff/damage (no assets needed), then gas.apply_effect / gas.remove_effect.\n3. Optional abilities: gas.give_ability (a project ability class, or effect = a defined effect for the built-in\n   effect ability), then gas.try_activate_ability or gas.send_gameplay_event (trigger_event).\n4. Inspect with gas.get_attribute_values, gas.get_active_effects, gas.get_active_tags, gas.get_granted_abilities.\nTags must exist in the gameplay tag table; unknown tags fail with close matches.","tools":[{"name":"add_ability_system","function":"AddAbilitySystem","description":"Gives an actor an ability system: adds an AbilitySystemComponent (unless it already has one), initializes its actor info and adds the generic attribute set (Health, MaxHealth, Shield, Stamina, MaxStamina, Mana, MaxMana, Speed, Damage) with initial values. Works on builder objects and any other actor. Undoable. Damage is a meta-attribute: an instant or periodic effect that adds to it subtracts from Shield first, then Health. While Health is 0 the actor has the tag Gas.State.Dead.\nReturns: The actor (id, name), whether a component was added, and the attribute values. Fails if the actor already has the generic attribute set, or on an unknown attribute name.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"The actor, e.g. \"n12\". (Reference to Actor: node id (n12), node path, actor:Name or object path)"},"attributes":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"number"},"description":"Initial values overriding the defaults (Health 100, MaxHealth 100, Shield 0, Stamina 100, MaxStamina 100, Mana 100, MaxMana 100, Speed 600), e.g. {\"Health\": 250, \"MaxHealth\": 250, \"Shield\": 50}. A Health above MaxHealth raises MaxHealth too."}},"required":["target"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"object","title":"RuntimeGasSystemInfo","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"The actor's node id (or actor:Name)."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Actor name."},"added_component":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if a new AbilitySystemComponent was added (false: the actor already had one)."},"attributes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","title":"RuntimeGasAttributeValue","properties":{"attribute_name":{"type":"string","description":"Short attribute name, e.g. \"Health\"."},"full_name":{"type":"string","description":"Attribute name with its set class, e.g. \"RuntimeGenericAttributeSet.Health\"."},"set_class_name":{"type":"string","description":"Attribute set class that owns the attribute, e.g. \"RuntimeGenericAttributeSet\"."},"base_value":{"type":"number","description":"Permanent base value, unaffected by temporary (duration) modifiers."},"current_value":{"type":"number","description":"Current value after all active modifiers."}}},"description":"Attribute values after initialization, sorted by full name."}},"description":"The actor (id, name), whether a component was added, and the attribute values. Fails if the actor already has the generic attribute set, or on an unknown attribute name."}},"required":["returnValue"]},"undoable":true,"irreversible":false,"requires_world":true,"async":false},{"name":"add_loose_tags","function":"AddLooseTags","description":"Adds loose gameplay tags to the actor's ability system (states such as stunned or on fire that no effect owns). Undoable.\nReturns: The owned tags afterwards, sorted. Fails on an unknown tag (with close matches).","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"Actor with an ability system, e.g. \"n12\". (Reference to Actor: node id (n12), node path, actor:Name or object path)"},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Existing tags, e.g. [\"Gas.State.Dead\"]."}},"required":["target","tags"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"The owned tags afterwards, sorted. Fails on an unknown tag (with close matches)."}},"required":["returnValue"]},"undoable":true,"irreversible":false,"requires_world":true,"async":false},{"name":"apply_effect","function":"ApplyEffect","description":"Applies a gameplay effect to the actor's ability system. Undoable (removes it again, or restores the base values an instant effect changed).\nReturns: Whether it applied, the active handle (-1 for instant), and attributes and tags afterwards. Fails on an unknown effect (lists defined effects) or a missing SetByCaller magnitude.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"Actor with an ability system, e.g. \"n12\". (Reference to Actor: node id (n12), node path, actor:Name or object path)"},"effect":{"type":"string","description":"A gas.define_effect name (e.g. \"Poison\") or a GameplayEffect class path (e.g. \"/Game/GE/GE_Burn.GE_Burn_C\")."},"set_by_caller":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"number"},"description":"Magnitudes for SetByCaller modifiers, e.g. {\"Gas.SetByCaller.Magnitude\": 25}."},"level":{"type":"number","description":"Effect level.","default":1},"instigator":{"type":"string","description":"Optional actor that caused it (shown in the effect context; drives aggregate_by_source stacking). (Reference to Actor: node id (n12), node path